STAFFCLAN - HollowDeep Staff

Syntax: staffclan [status]
        staffclan who
        staffclan say <message>
Aliases: hstaffclan; staffclan list lists the roster.

This clan is reserved for saved Mod, Implementor, Admin and Owner roles.
Membership follows role assignments automatically. Revoking a staff role
immediately removes both roster and chat access. Room assignments alone and
native staff classes without a HollowDeep staff role do not grant membership.
There are no invitations, fees, promotions, clan vaults or separate clan ranks.

Private chat reaches currently online staff only, includes the sender's role,
and respects timed mutes. Messages accept 1-160 printable ASCII characters;
there is no offline delivery or saved chat history. The roster includes offline
staff. Staff roles display as [MOD], [IMPLEMENTOR], [ADMIN] or [OWNER] in who,
whois, staff announcements and clan chat. Class, level and permissions stay intact.
